### 1.1 Pull-request run for this record

```text
$ gh run view 42289296520 --repo Oludammy2030/Hivorr \
    --json conclusion,headSha,workflowName,url
{"conclusion":"success","headSha":"8210f9804c19f129e3e71aa60bb66a72a6e6cc28",
 "url":"https://github.com/Oludammy2030/Hivorr/actions/runs/42289296520","workflowName":"CI"}
```

Trigger: `pull_request` for PR #19 (`docs/ep-01-001-entry-record` → `staging`).
All six jobs passed: `install`, `lint and format check`, `typecheck`, `test`, `build`,
`secret and dependency scan`.

```text
$ gh pr view 19 --repo Oludammy2030/Hivorr \
    --json number,baseRefName,headRefName,state,mergeable,reviewDecision
{"baseRefName":"staging","headRefName":"docs/ep-01-001-entry-record","mergeable":"MERGEABLE",
 "number":19,"reviewDecision":"","state":"OPEN"}
```

`reviewDecision` is empty: no review has been recorded. The run proves the pipeline passes; it does
not constitute review, approval or G2.

## 2. The EP-00 evidence run

```text
$ gh run view 42257026623 --repo Oludammy2030/Hivorr \
    --json databaseId,headSha,conclusion,status,workflowName,createdAt
{"conclusion":"success","createdAt":"2026-11-06T16:56:35Z","databaseId":42257026623,
 "headSha":"1668c304df446e4cce0612d1f6c2537f5965c767","status":"completed","workflowName":"CI"}
```

This is the green run recorded in `EP-00-010` §3. It targets `1668c30`, the evidence commit —
**not** the bootstrap tag commit `8029466`. That is the recorded C10 asymmetry: the tag predates
the pipeline, so no run can exist on the tag without rewriting history or the tag.

